O                0.2556216327        0.6167671720        0.3959492328
O                0.2204724264        0.9010066216        0.9417649669
O                0.7795275736        0.9010066216        0.5582350331
O                0.7759517948        0.0991274773        0.0585598080
O                0.2240482052        0.0991274773        0.4414401920

K_POINTS automatic
12 12 12 1 1 1

CELL_PARAMETERS angstrom
   4.5689412812   0.0000000000   0.0009568715
   0.0000000000   5.6122733897   0.0000000000
  -0.0525858794   0.0000000000   4.9368302630

HUBBARD {ortho-atomic}
